WEBVTT

00:03.562 --> 00:03.682
Ah.

00:12.068 --> 00:12.128
Ah.

00:27.982 --> 00:31.705
I would like to say a few words about my life.

00:32.706 --> 00:36.170
When I was a child, I had a friend who was a monk.

00:36.510 --> 00:40.073
He was a Buddhist monk.

00:40.113 --> 00:41.074
He was a Buddhist monk.

00:41.094 --> 00:44.437
He was a Buddhist monk.

00:56.260 --> 00:56.380
.

00:56.400 --> 00:56.500
.

00:56.520 --> 00:56.540
.

00:56.560 --> 00:56.640
.

00:56.660 --> 00:56.680
.

01:13.267 --> 01:13.327
.

01:13.387 --> 01:13.427
.

01:13.467 --> 01:13.507
.

01:13.547 --> 01:13.707
.

01:13.748 --> 01:13.768
.

01:35.587 --> 01:35.647
.

01:35.667 --> 01:35.687
.

01:35.747 --> 01:35.767
.

01:35.807 --> 01:35.867
.

01:35.887 --> 01:35.907
